{
  "_meta": {
    "category": "overlays",
    "description": "3-stage process chain on experiment.pulse with one whole-chain OVERLAY_DELTA_VS_STAGE (ref.index 0, target.index 2): stage-2 value - stage-0 value per region, in the target stage's units. The stages are those of 11_chain_whole_chain_index_vs_stage.json (revenue summed per region, then re-summed twice), so every delta is 0: the chain reconciles. A target stage shaped differently from the reference emits PULSE_OVERLAY_CHAIN_STAGE_SHAPE_DIVERGENT; a zero reference is not PULSE_OVERLAY_REF_ZERO (subtraction is defined). Buffered: the layer runs after every stage finishes. Renderers centre colour ramps on baseline 0.",
    "intents": [
      "benchmark"
    ],
    "name": "chain-delta-vs-stage",
    "operators": [
      "AGG_SUM",
      "GROUP_CATEGORY"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "cohort-analysis",
      "comparison",
      "composed",
      "overlay"
    ]
  },
